Package: aowis-server-map
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, apache2, openssl, systemd
Suggests: certbot, python3-certbot-apache
Description: AOWIS caching map tile server
 AOWIS Server Map is a Qt-based HTTP service that caches map tiles for the
 AOWIS Server GUI. The package installs a hardened systemd service, generates
 separate read and delete API keys on first installation, and provides disabled
 Apache reverse-proxy site templates for local and Internet-facing deployments.
